# Third-party material

The four white Bongo Cat PNG frames in `assets/` are derived from `images/cat.png`, `images/mouth.png`, `images/paw-left.png`, and `images/paw-right.png` in [Externalizable/bongo.cat](https://github.com/Externalizable/bongo.cat). Each local frame composes the source cat, mouth, and relevant raised or striking paw sprites; no bongo artwork is included.

The `black-cat-*.png` variants are local derivatives of these source-based outline frames: the white raster strokes are rendered black for light Omarchy themes.

